Spec: Customer Control Center recovery
Platform: Loadder Customer Control Center
Purpose:
  Recover a narrow, read-only, workspace-scoped customer dashboard that links to canonical operational products.
Owns:
  - GET /api/control-center/summary and its dashboard presentation.
  - Capability-aware links and truthful empty-state summaries.
Can modify:
  - server/app/routes/control-center.mjs
  - server/app/services/control-center-service.mjs
  - server/app/repositories/control-center-repository.mjs
  - src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx
  - focused Control Center tests and isolated E2E.
Must:
  - Scope every summary record to the authenticated workspace.
  - Be read-only and link to existing canonical Website, Commerce, Booking, Content, Customers, Leads, Campaigns, and Analytics surfaces only when available.
  - Derive enabled actions from persisted resolved capability state.
  - Return zero/empty values honestly for a new workspace; never fabricate orders, revenue, leads, or campaigns.
  - Remain usable at 390px without material horizontal overflow.
Must not:
  - Duplicate operational persistence, bypass canonical authorization, or infer Booking/Content availability solely in the frontend.
Done when:
  - Focused service/route/UI tests and isolated browser acceptance prove enabled, booking-disabled, empty-workspace, and mobile scenarios.
Scenario: Empty workspace
  Given an authenticated workspace with no projects or operational records
  When it requests the Control Center summary
  Then the response contains truthful zero counts and no enabled capability action.
